, and I applaud Behold for using some of the awesomeness of Chroma Squad to make Galaxy even more incredible.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Brash Games<br><br>\u201cIt's slick, it's superbly polished, and the new ideas it throws into the mix will have you enthralled from the first digital dice-roll to the last.\u201d<br>Pocket Gamer<br><br>\u201cBehold Studios has kicked things up a notch for this game. The music and presentation are a cut above the older games, the humor is on point, and they\u2019ve worked in a special system for ship battles.\u201d<br>Kotaku<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_cc1fd3a80176caac3da4c2a12dccca34d6b69063.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726496056","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_cc1fd3a80176caac3da4c2a12dccca34d6b69063.600x338.jpg?t=1726496056"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_0bad5ed65da2d920210069a05540293e7dd46c6b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726496056","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_0bad5ed65da2d920210069a05540293e7dd46c6b.600x338.jpg?t=1726496056"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_8b441fc1babda0e6f0912e4be12118f016c24781.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726496056","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_8b441fc1babda0e6f0912e4be12118f016c24781.600x338.jpg?t=1726496056"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_21a4558a4f35d90135d2d8ded9867dea4a783cc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1726496056","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_21a4558a4f35d90135d2d8ded9867dea4a783cc9.600x338.jpg?t=1726496056"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/349790/ss_f8f